{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_04B0A0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"我以前有一本收集海盗传说的书。按书里的说法，雄火龙也被称为“空之王者”。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":108,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"一般流传下来的形象，是长着翅膀的龙……也就是所谓的飞龙。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"飞龙……就是弗拉德公爵纹章上用过的那种双足<R=龙,DRAGON>吗。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=龙,DRAGON>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":83,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"对，就是那个后来成为德古拉原型的弗拉德公爵的纹章。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"听说还有船在连岛影都看不见的远海遭到袭击，所以雄火龙大概能飞相当远的距离。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"还有，据说雄火龙会喷火。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"喷火？不可能有那种生物！","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"对手可是<R=怪物,MONSTRUO>。这种常识最好趁早扔掉。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=怪物,MONSTRUO>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":67,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"}]}